  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1066674289/v0.22.5</id>
    <updated>2026-07-21T19:05:10Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/releases/tag/v0.22.5"/>
    <title>v0.22.5</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;🔒 Security release&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixes &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/security/advisories/GHSA-5286-6cm5-w3qv&quot;&gt;GHSA-5286-6cm5-w3qv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — an SSRF guard bypass in media-URL validation (CWE-918). Upgrading is recommended for anyone running the HTTP/tunnel transports, especially on cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The issue&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;validateMediaUrl()&lt;/code&gt; used a range &lt;strong&gt;blocklist&lt;/strong&gt; that missed the IPv6 transition ranges &lt;code&gt;ipaddr.js&lt;/code&gt; can return (&lt;code&gt;rfc6052&lt;/code&gt;/NAT64, &lt;code&gt;rfc6145&lt;/code&gt;/SIIT, &lt;code&gt;6to4&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;teredo&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;benchmarking&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;amt&lt;/code&gt;). An attacker could bypass the guard with a literal like &lt;code&gt;http://[64:ff9b::169.254.169.254]/&lt;/code&gt; that encodes a private IPv4 (e.g. cloud metadata) — on a NAT64-enabled network the request would route to the internal target.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affected:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 0.15.1, &amp;lt;= 0.22.4&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;strong&gt;Patched in:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;0.22.5&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The fix (and hardening beyond the report)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blocklist → fail-closed allowlist&lt;/strong&gt; — only public &lt;code&gt;unicast&lt;/code&gt; addresses are permitted; the entire transition-range class, and any range future &lt;code&gt;ipaddr.js&lt;/code&gt; versions add, is blocked by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embedded-IPv4 extraction&lt;/strong&gt; — IPv4-mapped (&lt;code&gt;::ffff:0:0/96&lt;/code&gt;) &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; deprecated IPv4-compatible (&lt;code&gt;::/96&lt;/code&gt;, e.g. &lt;code&gt;::a9fe:a9fe&lt;/code&gt;) addresses are unwrapped and re-checked, so an internal IPv4 wrapped in IPv6 can&#39;t slip through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All DNS records validated&lt;/strong&gt; — a host resolving to a public record plus a private sibling is now rejected (previously only the first record was checked).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;allowedHosts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; now normalizes IPs (embedded-IPv4 + IPv6 form) and handles bracketed IPv6 literals; the IP escape hatch requires every resolved address to be allowlisted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reported by &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tonghuaroot&quot;&gt;tonghuaroot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — thank you for the responsible disclosure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🧹 Maintenance&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dependency upgrades + security-advisory cleanup (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4936943694&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/issues/44&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/pull/44/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/pull/44&quot;&gt;#44&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore(deps): dependency upgrades + security advisory cleanup (v0.22.4) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/anatoly314/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anatoly314&quot;&gt;@anatoly314&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4936943694&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/issues/44&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/pull/44/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/pull/44&quot;&gt;#44&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(security): harden media-URL SSRF guard against IPv6 transition bypass (v0.22.5) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/anatoly314/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anatoly314&quot;&gt;@anatoly314&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4942146704&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/issues/46&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/pull/46/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ankimcp/anki-mcp-server/pull/46&quot;&gt;#46&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
